sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Use as Usage stream
    participant Cost as Cost attribution
    participant Bud as Budget tracker
    participant Ev as Evaluator
    participant Own as Service owner
    Use->>Cost: resource consumption per service
    Cost->>Bud: spend attributed to an owner
    Bud->>Ev: burn rate against the monthly budget
    Ev->>Ev: compare with the reliability budget too
    alt spending fast and reliability is fine
        Ev->>Own: ticket — over-provisioned, trim it
    else spending fast because reliability is at risk
        Ev-->>Bud: suppress — the spend is buying the SLO
    else projected to blow the budget
        Ev->>Own: page before the month ends, not after
    end
